OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Greatest
OL,6,G     Showstoppers
OL,7,     F2/4. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,8,     Fstory of Devon-born harp virtuoso
OL,9,     FElias Parish Alvars.
OL,10,G1700 In Tune
OL,11,     FPetroc welcomes pianist Charlotte
OL,12,     FHu to In Tune.
OL,13,G1900 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,14,     FKazuki Yamada conducts the CBSO in
OL,15,     Fsea-related music by Bax, Debussy
OL,16,     Fand Anna Clyne. The orchestra is
OL,17,     Falso joined by Alice Sara Ott for
OL,18,     Fa performance of Grieg's Piano
OL,19,     FConcerto.
