OL,5,G2145 The Essay: Coltrane's Sound
OL,6,     FLegendary jazz musician Archie
OL,7,     FShepp remembers his friend and
OL,8,     Fmentor John Coltrane. Presented by
OL,9,     FAshley Kahn.
OL,10,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,11,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,12,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,13,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,14,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,15,     Feverything in between.
OL,16,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,17,     FTonight, Soweto welcomes
OL,18,     Fsaxophonist and bandleader Lakecia
OL,19,     FBenjamin as his next guest, as she
OL,20,     Fspotlights three records by
OL,21,     FColtrane that have influenced her.
